# INOS architecture

Use this execution chain:

governed source -> compiled/runtime contract -> identity -> exact-context authority -> AIM route -> mission envelope -> runtime -> artifact/receipt -> BUILD -> durable reference.

Cursor occupies only the runtime/execution-surface position.

Do not re-architect institution identity, TWIN/SovereignCounterpart ontology, AIM routing policy, BUILD validation authority, or ARK custody unless the assigned mission explicitly requests architecture work under the correct lane.
